cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the measurement it reports, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "icsmatch: matching ICS/OT security advisories to asset inventories without CPE"
authors:
  - family-names: Alshuhail
    given-names: Lama
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lamaAlshuhail/icsmatch"
keywords:
  - CSAF
  - ICS
  - OT security
  - vulnerability management
  - CPE
  - VEX
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that matches CISA CSAF 2.0 advisories against an OT asset
  inventory. Accompanies a measurement of product identifier coverage across the
  CISA ICS corpus (4,021 advisories, 27,664 products, cisagov/CSAF commit 6f2e04f,
  19 September 2026): 0.10% of products carry a CPE while 29.43% carry a model or
  order number.
